<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.27 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.09 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.52 vs   0.16</p>
<p> Sales		   20.96 vs  13.90</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.17 vs   1.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.45 vs   2.28</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.46 vs   2.30</p>
<p> Sales		   44.85 vs  29.40</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Zaklady Piwowarskie w</p>
<p>Zywcu Zywiec SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
